AU  - Young, CJC; Williams, HJ; Ferro, CF; Wardour, EF; Pask, EN; Lee, SJ
TI  - Advanced Crop Management and Health Assessment using Multispectral UAVs for Precision Agriculture
T2  - AIAA AVIATION FORUM AND ASCEND 2025
LA  - English
